    <bpmn:process id="W_W5194" name="W5194. DSWD (Social Welfare) &amp; Red Cross Priority Relief Delivery Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DSWD or Red Cross release of emergency PO (W5182)
Frequency: Event-driven per dispatch order
Volume: ~20–30 major delivery operations per storm
Owner: Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Participants: Fleet Drivers, DSWD Warehouse Receiver, Port Liaison Officer
Source: workflow W5194 — DSWD (Social Welfare) &amp; Red Cross Priority Relief Delivery Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5194_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5194_Lane1" name="Logistics Dispatch Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5194_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5194_Start3" name="DSWD or Red Cross release of emergency PO (W5182)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5194_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5194_Task4" name="Secure emergency dispatch manifest: verify destination DSWD/Red Cross drop-off…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Secure emergency dispatch manifest: verify destination DSWD/Red Cross drop-off facility or disaster zone.
Responsible (R): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Accountable (A): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5194_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5194_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5194_Task5" name="Apply DSWD priority transport banner on delivery trucks to bypass traffic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply DSWD priority transport banner on delivery trucks to bypass traffic checkpoints and port queues.
Responsible (R): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Accountable (A): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5194_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5194_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5194_Task6" name="Execute delivery: transport relief kits or building supplies, monitor vehicle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute delivery: transport relief kits or building supplies, monitor vehicle GPS, and communicate safety status.
Responsible (R): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Accountable (A): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5194_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5194_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5194_Task7" name="Obtain DSWD/Red Cross signed Goods Receipt Slip and delivery receipt…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Obtain DSWD/Red Cross signed Goods Receipt Slip and delivery receipt verification.
Responsible (R): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Accountable (A): Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5194_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5194_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5194_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5194_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5194_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-772 (ensure controlled execution — Priority Relief Routing, LGU Coordination &amp; Humanitarian Partner Logistics (PA-180.3).) | - CTL-772: Signed receipts scanned and uploaded to ERP project tracking database; driver logs reconciled.
Owner: Logistics Dispatch Supervisor (VS-06) / 3PL Coordinator (VS-56)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5194_Assoc10" sourceRef="W5194_Annotation9" targetRef="W5194_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5194_Flow11" sourceRef="W5194_Start3" targetRef="W5194_Task4" />
