Volume: ~5–10 store hubs set up annually
Owner: Store Manager / Regional Operations Coordinator
Participants: Store Staff, CSR Foundation team (VS-152), Local Barangay Officials
Source: workflow W5196 — Store-Level Disaster Relief Hub Setup &amp; Community Distribution Point Operations</bpmn:documentation>
