Responsible (R): Store Manager / Regional Operations Coordinator
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Regional Operations Coordinator
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5196_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5196_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
