        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-772 (ensure controlled execution — Priority Relief Routing, LGU Coordination &amp; Humanitarian Partner Logistics (PA-180.3).) | - CTL-772: Bulk fuel deliveries verified by weighbridge / dip-stick; fuel disbursements log signed by LP.
Owner: Fuel &amp; Fleet Cost Manager (VS-61) / Fleet Supervisor (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
