    <bpmn:process id="W_W5200" name="W5200. Post-Disaster Supply Chain Recovery, Lessons-Learned &amp; BCP Update" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: De-activation of disaster response plan (typically 30 days post-storm)
Frequency: Post-event
Volume: 1 comprehensive review per major storm
Owner: Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Participants: VP Supply Chain, Store Ops VP, CFO, VP Supply Chain, LP Director
Source: workflow W5200 — Post-Disaster Supply Chain Recovery, Lessons-Learned &amp; BCP Update</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5200_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5200_Lane1" name="Director of Business Continuity">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5200_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5200_Start3" name="De-activation of disaster response plan (typically 30 days post-storm)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5200_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5200_Task4" name="De-mobilize emergency logistics zones at DCs; return fleet vehicles to standard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: De-mobilize emergency logistics zones at DCs; return fleet vehicles to standard delivery schedules.
Responsible (R): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Accountable (A): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5200_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5200_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5200_Task5" name="Conduct post-disaster audit: review margin losses, inventory write-offs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct post-disaster audit: review margin losses, inventory write-offs, transport delays, and compliance issues.
Responsible (R): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Accountable (A): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5200_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5200_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5200_Task6" name="Host the Lessons-Learned Workshop: gather feedback from store managers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Host the Lessons-Learned Workshop: gather feedback from store managers, drivers, and procurement team.
Responsible (R): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Accountable (A): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5200_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5200_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5200_Task7" name="Update the Business Continuity Plan (BCP) and S&amp;OP staging models based on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Update the Business Continuity Plan (BCP) and S&amp;OP staging models based on findings; submit updates to Board Risk Committee (VS-36).
Responsible (R): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Accountable (A): Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5200_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5200_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5200_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5200_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5200_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-772 (ensure controlled execution — Priority Relief Routing, LGU Coordination &amp; Humanitarian Partner Logistics (PA-180.3).) | - CTL-772: BCP updates signed off by Risk Manager and COO; training scheduled for next season.
Owner: Director of Business Continuity / Risk Manager (VS-26)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
